e10e28></path><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="m375.029 44.758-8.194 7.622v9.655h33.856L416 46.79V16.3L400.691 1.055h-33.856v9.973l8.194 7.622v26.108Zm33.222-6.352-6.353 6.352-19.056.063V18.714h19.056l6.353 6.352v13.34Z" fill="#fff" data-v-03e10e28></path></svg><h2 data-v-03e10e28>We’re trusted to deliver</h2><p class="text__desc" data-v-03e10e28>Each year, we handle 800+ million packages for our customers and top retailers, including Next, Missguided, John Lewis, eBay and Amazon.

With over 4 million 5-star ratings and more reviews on Trustpilot than any other UK carrier, we’re proud to rank as a GREAT service provider.

Check out our reviews to see how we’re delivering:</p></div><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe_EVRI_LOCATION_02_16168a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1616.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1616.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6XpoZbqstJ9-Wbe_EVRI_LOCATION_02_1616.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A customer is standing in the doorway of their home holding their parcel and smiling for the photo." width="1000" height="667" class="trustpilot__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-03e10e28><a href="#skip-reviews" class="trustpilot__skip" data-v-03e10e28>skip reviews</a><div class="trustpilot__widget trustpilot-widget trustpilot-slice" data-locale="en-GB" data-template-id="53aa8912dec7e10d38f59f36" data-businessunit-id="620fbe077a2b86af5e54e1a2" data-style-height="140px" data-style-width="100%" data-theme="light" data-stars="4,5" data-review-languages="en" data-font-family="Poppins" data-v-03e10e28><a href="https://uk.trustpilot.com/review/www.evri.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-v-03e10e28> Trustpilot </a></div></div><span id="skip-reviews" data-v-03e10e28></span></section><section id="digital-signature-faqs" class="faqs" index="7" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>Digital signature FAQs</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What is the difference between a digital signature and tracked delivery?-open answer" data-test-id="whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What is the difference between a digital signature and tracked delivery?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whatisthedifferencebetweenadigitalsignatureandtrackeddelivery-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Tracked delivery shows where your parcel is along its entire journey. Our tracking service is included as standard. Senders can check where their parcel is at each stage of its journey and receive end-to-end tracking up to the point of delivery.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->With a digital signature, your parcel will be delivered directly to someone at the address or neighbour if the recipient isn&#39;t available. A recipient needs to acknowledge they have accepted the parcel. This will be provided as photographic proof of delivery for the sender which can be accessed using your account.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-How will I know when my digital signature parcel has been received?-open answer" data-test-id="howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>How will I know when my digital signature parcel has been received?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="howwilliknowwhenmydigitalsignatureparcelhasbeenreceived-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We provide end-to-end tracking as standard with every package that enters our network. When you request a digital signature, your recipient will need to acknowledge they have accepted the parcel. This will be provided as photographic proof of delivery for the sender which can be accessed using your account. If no one is available to receive the parcel, our Courier will take a photo to show a delivery has been attempted and will try to redeliver the next working day.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Do I need to buy cover if my parcel includes a digital signature?-open answer" data-test-id="doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do I need to buy cover if my parcel includes a digital signature?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doineedtobuycoverifmyparcelincludesadigitalsignature-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our digital signature service means we&#39;ll provide photographic proof your parcel was accepted by someone at the delivery address or neighbour. With each package you send with Evri, we include cover up to £20 for FREE. This means in the unlikely event of loss or damage, our standard cover will compensate you up to the item value you have given us, up to £20.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If your parcel’s worth more than £20, you can increase the value of cover up to £999. Parcel cover alone does not fully guarantee your parcel will be received by the intended recipient but it will protect you against loss or damage. We recommend increasing parcel cover for items worth over £20 and, if your parcel is valuable or needs proof of delivery, also requesting a digital signature for peace of mind. Plus, if you upgrade cover for a parcel worth over £50, a signature will be automatically required. See our guide on <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/guides/parcel-cover" rel="noreferrer" target="_self"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->parcel cover<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> more more information.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Please note that non-compensation items and Postable parcels aren’t covered, no matter their value. When you send any of these items, it’s at your own risk. Check our list of <!--]--><!--]--><a href="/send/what-i-can-and-cannot-send" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->prohibited and non-compensation items<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> before you send your parcel.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--></div></section><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--></main></div></div><div id="teleports"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__NUXT__.config={public:{ENV_NAME:"prod",PUBLIC_PATH:"https://www.evri.com",WEB_BASE:"https://www.evri.com/",PRISMIC_REPO:"ev-mercury",DEVTOOLS:false,API_BASE:"https://api.hermesworld.co.uk/",AUTH0_USERS_ENDPOINT:"https://hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com/userinfo",AUTH0_CLIENT_ID:"dC8K22keYtRszHe7dnmlWSve2kP7mUBF",AUTH0_DOMAIN:"hermes-df-prod.eu.auth0.com",AUTH0_LOGIN_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",AUTH0_LOGOUT_REDIRECT:"https://www.evri.com/",ASSETLINKS_PATH:"assetlinks-prod.json",APPLE_MERCHANT_DOMAIN_PATH:"apple-developer-merchantid-domain-association-PROD.txt",APPLE_APP_SITE_ASSOCIATION_PATH:"apple-app-site-association-PROD",CHAT